# Weather in Russian: холодно, тепло, идёт снег
subtitle: "Talk about the weather in Russian: хо́лодно, тепло́, жа́рко with no \"it is\", бы́ло and бу́дет for yesterday and tomorrow, snow that \"goes\", and the four seasons."
teaches: ["vocabulary/weather"]
thumb: "band \"In Russian, snow walks\" note \"идёт снег\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Around town in Russian: в магазине, на работе","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/34-russian-town.cast"}

## Weather in Russian: холодно, тепло, идёт снег
