    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Приве́т! В Москве́ хо́лодно?","gloss":"Hi! Is it cold in Moscow?"},{"by":"b","text":"О́чень хо́лодно! Идёт снег.","gloss":"Very cold! It's snowing."},{"by":"a","text":"А в Ло́ндоне идёт дождь.","gloss":"And in London it's raining."},{"by":"b","text":"Зимо́й тут хо́лодно.","gloss":"It's cold here in winter."}] size 1.3 x 500 width 660 hidden true
