    card title Weather

A: How do you talk about the weather in Russian: cold, rain, snow, winter?
    draw a_cloud a_q parallel true

    erase a_q

B: Сего́дня хо́лодно.
    draw g_today

A: Today, cold: that's all it takes, with no it and no is. First the words for how it feels, then rain and snow, then the seasons.
    highlight g_today_w_2 color #c9871a effect underline

    erase a_cloud g_today

B: Хо́лодно is cold, and тепло́ is warm.
    draw b_i1 b_w1 b_g1 b_i2 b_w2 b_g2

A: Жа́рко is hot, as Moscow can be in July.
    draw b_i3 b_w3 b_g3

B: All three end in о, like хорошо́: one word says how it is.
    highlight b_w1 b_w2 b_w3 part о$ color #c9871a

A: And if you're cold yourself, it goes to yo (@draw b_me b_me_g@)u, like your age: мне хо́лодно, I'm cold.

    erase b_i1 b_w1 b_g1 b_i2 b_w2 b_g2 b_i3 b_w3 b_g3 b_me b_me_g

B: Now yesterday: вчера́, and add бы́ло. Вчера́ бы́ло тепло́, it was warm.
    draw c_i2 c_h2 c_s2 c_g2 c_i1 c_h1 c_s1 c_g1

A: Бы́ло is lesson eighteen's оно́ form, because the weather has no he or she.
    highlight c_s1 part бы́ло color #c9871a effect underline

B: And tomorrow takes бу́дет, from lesson thirty-two: за́втра бу́дет жа́рко, it will be hot.
    draw c_i3 c_h3 c_s3 c_g3

    erase c_i1 c_h1 c_s1 c_g1 c_i2 c_h2 c_s2 c_g2 c_i3 c_h3 c_s3 c_g3

A: Rain and snow don't fall in Russian: they go. Идёт дождь, it's raining.
    draw d_rain d_rain_t d_rain_g

B: Идёт снег, it's snowing.
    draw d_snow d_snow_t d_snow_g

A: Идёт is он идёт from lesson twenty-seven, going on foot.
    highlight d_snow_t part Идёт color #c9871a effect underline

    erase d_rain d_rain_t d_rain_g d_snow d_snow_t d_snow_g

B: Now the year. Зима́ is winter, and весна́ is spring.
    draw e_i1 e_n1 e_g1 e_i2 e_n2 e_g2

A: Ле́то is summer, the word behind лет, and о́сень is autumn.
    draw e_i3 e_n3 e_g3 e_i4 e_n4 e_g4

B: For in winter there's no в: the word changes its end. (@draw e_w1 e_w2@) Зима́ becomes зимо́й, and весна́, весно́й.

A: Ле́то becomes ле́том, and о́сень, о́сенью.
    draw e_w3 e_w4

    hide e_i1 e_n1 e_g1 e_w1 e_i2 e_n2 e_g2 e_w2 e_i3 e_n3 e_g3 e_w3 e_i4 e_n4 e_g4 e_w4

    icon k_snowman size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["snowflake"] icon_look picture of snowman

    quiz "In winter it snows. Which is right? Pick one." reveal.text "Зимо́й идёт снег." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b
        right: Зимо́й already means in winter: no в needed.
        wrong: Look for the one-word in winter.
        * В зима́ идёт снег.
        + Зимо́й идёт снег.
        * Зима́ идёт снег.

    pause 1

    erase k_snowman question_1_stamp

B: Now Tom calls me from London.
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name parallel true

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

A: Ле́том жа́рко: one word for in summer, one for hot, and no is anywhere.
    highlight talk2_2_words part "Ле́том жа́рко" color #c9871a effect underline

    erase talk2

    hide speakers

    draw t_snow

    quiz "Which one says it's snowing? Pick one." reveal.text "Идёт снег." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 store q1 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Снег is snow, and it goes: идёт снег.
        wrong: Дождь is rain; you want the snow.
        * Идёт дождь.
        * Бы́ло тепло́.
        + Идёт снег.

    pause 1.2

    erase t_snow q1_stamp

    draw t_sun

    quiz "Yesterday it was warm: Вчера́ … тепло́. Which word fills the gap?" reveal.text "Вчера́ бы́ло тепло́." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 store q2 voice b test t1
        right: With no he and no she in the weather, was is бы́ло, the оно́ form.
        wrong: No he and no she here: think of оно́.
        + бы́ло
        * был
        * была́

    pause 1.2

    erase t_sun q2_stamp

    draw t_snowman

    ask "Type the Russian for in winter." answer ["зимо́й","зимой"] default зимой reveal.text зимо́й reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 store q3 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Зима́ swaps its а for ой, with no в.
        wrong: Start from зима́ and change its end.

    pause 1.2

    erase t_snowman q3_stamp

    icon t_cold size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["snowflake"] icon_look picture of "cold face"

    quiz "You feel cold. How do you say so? Pick one." reveal.text "Мне хо́лодно." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 store q4 voice b test t1
        right: The cold goes to you, so it's мне.
        wrong: It's like your age: given to you.
        * Я хо́лодно.
        * Мне жа́рко.
        + Мне хо́лодно.

    pause 1.2

    erase t_cold q4_stamp

    icon t_leaf size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["maple leaf"] icon_look picture of "fallen leaf"

    quiz "What does О́сенью идёт дождь mean? Pick one." reveal.text "О́сенью идёт дождь." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 store q5 voice a test t1
        right: О́сенью is in autumn, and дождь is the rain.
        wrong: Check two words: the season, and what is going, дождь or снег.
        * In spring it rains.
        + In autumn it rains.
        * In autumn it snows.

    pause 1.2

    erase t_leaf q5_stamp

    show e_i1 e_n1 e_g1 e_w1 e_i2 e_n2 e_g2 e_w2 e_i3 e_n3 e_g3 e_w3 e_i4 e_n4 e_g4 e_w4

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    hide e_i1 e_n1 e_g1 e_w1 e_i2 e_n2 e_g2 e_w2 e_i3 e_n3 e_g3 e_w3 e_i4 e_n4 e_g4 e_w4

    show c_i1 c_h1 c_s1 c_g1 c_i2 c_h2 c_s2 c_g2 c_i3 c_h3 c_s3 c_g3

A: So Russian weather is short: one word for how it is, with бы́ло or бу́дет to move it in time.
    highlight c_s1 c_s2 c_s3 color #c9871a effect underline

    hide c_i1 c_h1 c_s1 c_g1 c_i2 c_h2 c_s2 c_g2 c_i3 c_h3 c_s3 c_g3

    show e_i1 e_n1 e_g1 e_w1 e_i2 e_n2 e_g2 e_w2 e_i3 e_n3 e_g3 e_w3 e_i4 e_n4 e_g4 e_w4

B: And for the time of year, one word too: зимо́й, весно́й, ле́том, о́сенью.
    highlight e_w1 e_w2 e_w3 e_w4 color #c9871a effect underline

    erase e_i1 e_n1 e_g1 e_w1 e_i2 e_n2 e_g2 e_w2 e_i3 e_n3 e_g3 e_w3 e_i4 e_n4 e_g4 e_w4

B: Сего́дня в Москве́ идёт снег, а мне нра́вится зима́! Next time, around town. Пока́!
    icon z_cloud size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 545 or ["snowflake"] icon_look picture of "cloud with snow"
    text z_line "Сего́дня в Москве́ идёт снег!" #3d3833 say "Сего́дня в Москве́ идёт снег!" say_voice b x 500 y 365 font_size 60

